        "short_description": {
            "database_value": "Compass Group Spain is a leading collective catering and food services company with over 60 years of experience. As a subsidiary of the multinational Compass Group, it serves hundreds of thousands of people daily, focusing on quality, safety, and personalized nutrition. The company employs around 13,000 people and generates annual sales exceeding 365 million euros.\n\nThe services offered by Compass Group Spain include corporate and industrial catering, educational catering, healthcare catering, senior and social services, event catering, and home meal delivery. They operate through specialized brands like Vilaplana for high-end catering and Medirest, which focuses on the socio-healthcare sector. Medirest has developed innovative projects to adapt traditional dishes for patients with specific dietary needs. The company serves a diverse clientele, including enterprises, schools, hospitals, and public administrations, and is committed to employee safety and development through certified quality systems.",
            "ai_value": "Trabajamos cada día para influir positivamente en la vida de los demás a través de la alimentación. Alimentamos de forma saludable a miles de personas desde hace más de 60 años. Nuestro lema: calidad, innovación y proximidad. Diseñamos y servimos una oferta gastronómica personalizada y saludable para todo tipo de necesidades y centros públicos y privados. Complementariamente, ofrecemos servicios de limpieza, mantenimiento y personal auxiliar."
        },
        "seo_description": {
